WHY THIS AND NOT AN OPEN SOURCE LICENCE
---------------------------------------
QuizForge is being built as a commercial product. Proprietary is the
deliberate default because the decision is one-way: a project can be
relicensed from proprietary to open source at any time, but once source has
been published under an open licence, that grant cannot be withdrawn from
anyone who already received it.

If open sourcing is ever wanted, this file is the only thing that needs to
change. Choosing it now would foreclose the option instead of preserving it.

